# CPrompt examples

# C.1Instruction Induction

Below is the original instruction induction prompt used by Honovich et al. (2023)

{{# system \~ }}   
You are a helpful assistant   
{{\~ /system }}   
{{# user \~}}   
I gave a friend an instruction and [n_demo]l inputs. The friend read the instruction and wrote an output for every one of the inputs. Here are the input - output pairs:   
{{ demos }}   
What was the instruction ? It has to be less than {{ max_tokens }} tokens .   
{{\~ /user }}   
{# assistant \~}}   
The instruction was {{gen ’instruction ’[ GENERATION_CONFIG ]]}   
{{\~ / assistant }}

